              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Linda T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really liked this. I don't eat sweet breakfasts so this was right up my alley. I tend to prefer waffles since they get crunchier so I am going to try this batter in my waffle maker next time. Neat idea"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
